  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You are swift afoot and able to keep your balance.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Sure and Fleet<sup>ARG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Your racial bonus on Acrobatics and Climb checks increases to +4, and you can move at full speed when using Acrobatics to balance on narrow, slippery, or otherwise treacherous terrain. If you expend one use of mythic power, you are not denied your Dexterity bonus when climbing or making Acrobatics checks for 1 minute.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-n-s-feats#toc99\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
